Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Autonomous AI coding agents can generate entire features in minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but running them in production without strict tool sandboxing is an engineering disaster waiting to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On the SWE-bench benchmark of 2,294 real-world software issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,baseline frontier models resolved under five percent of tasks, highlighting the challenge of repository-scale autonomous engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Research from MetaGPT shows that structuring agent collaboration with Standard Operating Procedures helps prevent circular coordination loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Without boundary contracts, unconstrained agent runs risk mutating workspace state or triggering silent regression bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The solution is deterministic runtime governance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tools must execute inside isolated sandboxes with strict schema contracts, structured error handling, and hardware-enforced boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comprehensive preflight verification and automated testing gates validate system state before changes deploy to live environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Build verifiable tool boundaries first, and your autonomous agents will operate with measurable reliability.
